hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"973","Abu Musa Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna narrated to us, Abdul Rahman narrated to us, Sufyan narrated to us, on the authority of Ibrahim bin Uqba, on the authority of Kurayb, on the authority of Osama Ibn Zayd said: “I departed with the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, from Arafat, and when he reached the end of the congregation, he called the call to prayer and established the iqama, then prayed the sunset prayer, then The last of the people did not arrive until he stayed and prayed the evening prayer.”"
